{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640,480\n\nSPRITE LOAD 1,\u0022Graphics/Anim/Anim_Earth_W150_H150_B48.png\u0022  ; ,150,150,48\nSPRITE POS 1,250,150\nSPRITE ZOOM 1,200,200\nSPRITE ON 1\n\nSPRITE LOAD 2,\u0022Graphics/Anim/Anim_Beast_W32_H56_B11.png\u0022   ; ,32,56,11\nSPRITE ON 2\nI=0 : J=0 : X=-32 : JUMP=0\n\nV=0\nMainLoop:\n  IF JUMP=4 THEN\n    JUMP=0\n\n    SPRITE FRAME 1,I\n    SPRITE ROTATE 1,V\n    INC I\n    IF I=48 THEN I=0\n  \n    SPRITE FRAME 2,J\n    SPRITE POS 2,X,200\n    INC J\n    IF J=11 THEN J=0\n  \n    INC V\n    IF V=360 THEN V=0\n  ENDIF\n  \n  INC X\n  IF X=640 THEN X=-32\n  \n  INC JUMP\n  \n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}